! missing test.db-journal  ->  it is not there
$ -d test.db --crash-at=commit -e "BEGIN; INSERT INTO t VALUES (2,'doomed'); COMMIT;"
开始了事务（接下来的改动要 COMMIT 才算数）
插入了 1 行
! exit 1
! exists test.db-journal  ->  it is there
$ -d test.db -e "SELECT * FROM t ORDER BY id;"
